			<li id="n-The-Ironclad" class="mw-list-item"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Ironclad"><span>The Ironclad</span></a></li><li id="n-The-Silent" class="mw-list-item"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Silent"><span>The Silent</span></a></li><li id="n-The-Regent" class="mw-list-item"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Regent"><span>The Regent</span></a></li><li id="n-The-Necrobinder" class="mw-list-item"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Necrobinder"><span>The Necrobinder</span></a></li><li id="n-The-Defect" class="mw-list-item"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Defect"><span>The Defect</span></a></li><li id="n-Ancients" class="mw-list-item"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Ancients"><span>Ancients</span></a></li><li id="n-Timeline" class="mw-list-item"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Timeline"><span>Timeline</span></a></li><li id="n-Acts" class="mw-list-item"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Acts"><span>Acts</span></a></li><li id="n-All-Cards" class="mw-list-item"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Cards_List"><span>All Cards</span></a></li><li id="n-All-Relics" class="mw-list-item"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Relics_List"><span>All Relics</span></a></li><li id="n-All-Potions" class="mw-list-item"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Potions_List"><span>All Potions</span></a></li><li id="n-All-Events" class="mw-list-item"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Events_List"><span>All Events</span></a></li><li id="n-Patch-Notes" class="mw-list-item"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Patch_Notes"><span>Patch Notes</span></a></li><li id="n-Multiplayer" class="mw-list-item"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Multiplayer"><span>Multiplayer</span></a></li>
		</ul>
		
