        <div
            class="wikigg-showcase__unit wikigg-showcase__reserved--lb"
            data-wgg-unit-type="internal"
        ></div>
</aside>

		<div class="content-body">
			<main>
				<a id="top"></a>
				<div id="siteNotice"></div>
				<div class="mw-indicators">
				</div>
				<h1 id="firstHeading" class="firstHeading mw-first-heading"><span class="mw-page-title-main">Bosses</span></h1>
				<div id="bodyContent" class="vector-body">
					<div id="siteSub" class="noprint">From Slay the Spire Wiki</div>
					<div id="contentSub"></div>
					<div id="contentSub2"></div>
					
					<div id="jump-to-nav"></div>
					<a class="mw-jump-link" href="#mw-head">Jump to navigation</a>
					<a class="mw-jump-link" href="#searchInput">Jump to search</a>
					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr"><div class="game-tabber noexcerpt"><div class="game-tab" style="border: 2px solid var(--wiki-accent-color--hover); border-bottom: none;"><a class="mw-selflink selflink">Slay the Spire</a></div> <div class="game-tab"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Bosses" title="Slay the Spire 2:Bosses">Slay the Spire 2</a></div></div><div class="hatnote">See <a href="/wiki/Map_Locations" title="Map Locations">Map Locations</a> for all possible rooms.</div>
<p>Bosses are extremely difficult monsters that are fought at the end of each act. Compared to normal enemies and elites, bosses have significantly more health and a more powerful move set that usually involves special gimmicks that cripple the player or heavily buffs itself. Every boss has a unique portrait shown at the top of the Spire map. 
</p><p>The map location prior to a boss fight will always be a <a href="/wiki/Map_Locations#Rest_Sites" title="Map Locations">Rest Site</a>, allowing the player to heal before the fight. The only exception to this is the <span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Corrupt Heart" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Corrupt_Heart#Corrupt_Heart" title="Corrupt Heart"><img alt="Map-CorruptHeart.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-CorruptHeart.png/22px-Map-CorruptHeart.png?9f6024" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Map-CorruptHeart.png/33px-Map-CorruptHeart.png?9f6024 1.5x, /images/thumb/Map-CorruptHeart.png/44px-Map-CorruptHeart.png?9f6024 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Corrupt_Heart#Corrupt_Heart" title="Corrupt Heart">Corrupt Heart</a></span> in <a href="/wiki/Acts#Act_4:_The_Ending" title="Acts">Act 4</a> which always has an elite encounter containing the <span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Spire Shield" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Spire_Shield_and_Spire_Spear#Spire_Shield" title="Spire Shield and Spire Spear"><img alt="EliteClear.png" src="/images/thumb/EliteClear.png/22px-EliteClear.png?9888cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EliteClear.png/33px-EliteClear.png?9888cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/EliteClear.png/44px-EliteClear.png?9888cd 2x" data-file-width="106" data-file-height="106" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Spire_Shield_and_Spire_Spear#Spire_Shield" title="Spire Shield and Spire Spear">Spire Shield</a></span> and <span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Spire Spear" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Spire_Shield_and_Spire_Spear#Spire_Spear" title="Spire Shield and Spire Spear"><img alt="EliteClear.png" src="/images/thumb/EliteClear.png/22px-EliteClear.png?9888cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EliteClear.png/33px-EliteClear.png?9888cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/EliteClear.png/44px-EliteClear.png?9888cd 2x" data-file-width="106" data-file-height="106" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Spire_Shield_and_Spire_Spear#Spire_Spear" title="Spire Shield and Spire Spear">Spire Spear</a></span>.
</p>
<div id="toc" class="toc" role="navigation" aria-labelledby="mw-toc-heading"><input type="checkbox" role="button" id="toctogglecheckbox" class="toctogglecheckbox" style="display:none" /><div class="toctitle" lang="en" dir="ltr"><h2 id="mw-toc-heading">Contents</h2><span class="toctogglespan"><label class="toctogglelabel" for="toctogglecheckbox"></label></span></div>
<ul>
