</ul>
</li>
<li class="toclevel-1 tocsection-6"><a href="#Act_1:_Exordium"><span class="tocnumber">4</span> <span class="toctext">Act 1: Exordium</span></a></li>
<li class="toclevel-1 tocsection-7"><a href="#Act_2:_The_City"><span class="tocnumber">5</span> <span class="toctext">Act 2: The City</span></a></li>
<li class="toclevel-1 tocsection-8"><a href="#Act_3:_The_Beyond"><span class="tocnumber">6</span> <span class="toctext">Act 3: The Beyond</span></a></li>
<li class="toclevel-1 tocsection-9"><a href="#Act_4:_The_Ending"><span class="tocnumber">7</span> <span class="toctext">Act 4: The Ending</span></a></li>
</ul>
</div>

<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Ascension_Modifiers">Ascension Modifiers</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Bosses?veaction=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: Ascension Modifiers" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Bosses?action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Ascension Modifiers"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<ul><li><span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="4" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">Ascension</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">4</span></sup></span>: Bosses deal more damage.</li>
<li><span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="9" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">Ascension</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">9</span></sup></span>: Bosses have more health and will sometimes gain more <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.</li>
<li><span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="19" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">Ascension</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">19</span></sup></span>: Bosses have more challenging movesets and abilities.</li>
<li><span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="20" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">Ascension</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">20</span></sup></span>: Two bosses are fought in a row at the end of <a href="/wiki/Act_3" class="mw-redirect" title="Act 3">Act 3</a>.</li></ul>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Rewards">Rewards</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Bosses?veaction=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section: Rewards" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Bosses?action=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Rewards"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<p>Upon defeating the <a href="/wiki/Act_1" class="mw-redirect" title="Act 1">Act 1</a> and <a href="/wiki/Act_2" class="mw-redirect" title="Act 2">Act 2</a> bosses, the player is rewarded with <a href="/wiki/Gold" title="Gold">Gold</a>, a choice between three <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?rarity=Rare"><span>Rare Cards</span></a></span>, a choice between three <span class="plainlink" data-name="Relics"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Relics_List?rarity=Boss"><span>Boss Relics</span></a></span>, and sometimes a random <a href="/wiki/Potions" title="Potions">Potion</a>. The player is healed for 100% (<span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="5" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">75%</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">5</span></sup></span>) of their missing health at the end of every boss battle.
</p><p>The <a href="/wiki/Act_3" class="mw-redirect" title="Act 3">Act 3</a> and <a href="/wiki/Acts#Act_4:_The_Ending" title="Acts">Act 4</a> bosses do not reward any consumables or cards.
</p><p>Killing a boss will add to a run's <a href="/wiki/Score" title="Score">Score</a>. Killing it without taking any damage, not including self-damaging cards like <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Bloodletting" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Bloodletting" title="Bloodletting"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Uncommon.png?64c48d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Skill_Uncommon.png?64c48d 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Bloodletting" title="Bloodletting">Bloodletting</a></span>, adds another 50 points. Killing all three bosses without taking any damage adds 200 points.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Interactions">Interactions</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Bosses?veaction=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: Interactions" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Bosses?action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Interactions"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Relics">Relics</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Bosses?veaction=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section: Relics" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Bosses?action=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Relics"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<ul><li><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Pantograph" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Pantograph" title="Pantograph"><img alt="Pantograph.png" src="/images/thumb/Pantograph.png/24px-Pantograph.png?da972c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Pantograph.png/36px-Pantograph.png?da972c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Pantograph.png/48px-Pantograph.png?da972c 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Pantograph" title="Pantograph">Pantograph</a></span>: Heals for 25 HP at the start of a boss encounter.</li>
<li><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Slaver&#39;s Collar" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Slaver%27s_Collar" title="Slaver&#39;s Collar"><img alt="SlaversCollar.png" src="/images/thumb/SlaversCollar.png/24px-SlaversCollar.png?f69488" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/SlaversCollar.png/36px-SlaversCollar.png?f69488 1.5x, /images/thumb/SlaversCollar.png/48px-SlaversCollar.png?f69488 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Slaver%27s_Collar" title="Slaver&#39;s Collar">Slaver's Collar</a></span>: Gain an extra <a href="/wiki/Keywords#Energy" title="Keywords">Energy</a> at the start of each Boss and Elite encounter.</li></ul>
<p><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Wing Boots" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Wing_Boots" title="Wing Boots"><img alt="WingedGreaves.png" src="/images/thumb/WingedGreaves.png/24px-WingedGreaves.png?5fef6d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/WingedGreaves.png/36px-WingedGreaves.png?5fef6d 1.5x, /images/thumb/WingedGreaves.png/48px-WingedGreaves.png?5fef6d 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Wing_Boots" title="Wing Boots">Wing Boots</a></span> <i>cannot</i> be used to skip boss fights, as all paths in the map will lead to the boss.
</p>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Other">Other</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Bosses?veaction=edit&amp;section=5" title="Edit section: Other" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Bosses?action=edit&amp;section=5" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Other"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<p>During the  <span class="event-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Mind Bloom" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Mind_Bloom" title="Mind Bloom"><img alt="EventClear.png" src="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/20px-EventClear.png?8b40cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/30px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/EventClear.png/40px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 2x" data-file-width="74" data-file-height="74" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Mind_Bloom" title="Mind Bloom">Mind Bloom</a></span> event, choosing <span class="frame-styling"><b>[I Am War]</b></span> starts a fight with a random Act 1 boss for a random <span class="plainlink" data-name="Relics"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Relics_List?rarity=Rare"><span>Rare Relic</span></a></span>. This fight does not add towards the run's <a href="/wiki/Score" title="Score">Score</a>, but will activate the above relics as normal. This fight will not count towards the achievement <span class="plainlink" data-name="Achievements"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Achievements?search=Perfect"><span>Perfect</span></a></span>.
</p><p><br />
To fight the <span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Corrupt Heart" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Corrupt_Heart#Corrupt_Heart" title="Corrupt Heart"><img alt="Map-CorruptHeart.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-CorruptHeart.png/22px-Map-CorruptHeart.png?9f6024" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Map-CorruptHeart.png/33px-Map-CorruptHeart.png?9f6024 1.5x, /images/thumb/Map-CorruptHeart.png/44px-Map-CorruptHeart.png?9f6024 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Corrupt_Heart#Corrupt_Heart" title="Corrupt Heart">Corrupt Heart</a></span>, the player must kill the <a href="/wiki/Act_3" class="mw-redirect" title="Act 3">Act 3</a> boss with the <a href="/wiki/Ironclad" title="Ironclad">Ironclad</a>, <a href="/wiki/Silent" title="Silent">Silent</a>, and <a href="/wiki/Defect" title="Defect">Defect</a> at least once. This means the Heart cannot be fought on the first playthrough of any character except for the <a href="/wiki/Watcher" title="Watcher">Watcher</a>.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Act_1:_Exordium">Act 1: Exordium</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Bosses?veaction=edit&amp;section=6" title="Edit section: Act 1: Exordium" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Bosses?action=edit&amp;section=6" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Act 1: Exordium"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<p>One of these bosses will appear on floor 16.
</p>
<div class="center-table">
<div class="boss">
<p><a href="/wiki/Slime_Boss" title="Slime Boss"><img alt="Map-SlimeBoss.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-SlimeBoss.png/300px-Map-SlimeBoss.png?229cee" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="boss-img" srcset="/images/thumb/Map-SlimeBoss.png/450px-Map-SlimeBoss.png?229cee 1.5x, /images/Map-SlimeBoss.png?229cee 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a>
</p>
<div class="boss-name"><a href="/wiki/Slime_Boss" title="Slime Boss">Slime Boss</a></div>
</div>
<div class="boss">
<p><a href="/wiki/The_Guardian" title="The Guardian"><img alt="Map-Guardian.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-Guardian.png/300px-Map-Guardian.png?188be6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="boss-img" srcset="/images/thumb/Map-Guardian.png/450px-Map-Guardian.png?188be6 1.5x, /images/Map-Guardian.png?188be6 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a>
</p>
<div class="boss-name"><a href="/wiki/The_Guardian" title="The Guardian">The Guardian</a></div>
</div>
<div class="boss">
<p><a href="/wiki/Hexaghost" title="Hexaghost"><img alt="Map-Hexaghost.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-Hexaghost.png/300px-Map-Hexaghost.png?15a4c7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="boss-img" srcset="/images/thumb/Map-Hexaghost.png/450px-Map-Hexaghost.png?15a4c7 1.5x, /images/Map-Hexaghost.png?15a4c7 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a>
</p>
<div class="boss-name"><a href="/wiki/Hexaghost" title="Hexaghost">Hexaghost</a></div>
</div>
</div>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Act_2:_The_City">Act 2: The City</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Bosses?veaction=edit&amp;section=7" title="Edit section: Act 2: The City" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Bosses?action=edit&amp;section=7" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Act 2: The City"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<p>One of these bosses will appear on floor 33.
</p>
<div class="center-table">
<div class="boss">
<p><a href="/wiki/Bronze_Automaton" title="Bronze Automaton"><img alt="Map-Automaton.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-Automaton.png/300px-Map-Automaton.png?aad83e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="boss-img" srcset="/images/thumb/Map-Automaton.png/450px-Map-Automaton.png?aad83e 1.5x, /images/Map-Automaton.png?aad83e 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a>
</p>
<div class="boss-name"><a href="/wiki/Bronze_Automaton" title="Bronze Automaton">Bronze Automaton</a></div>
</div>
<div class="boss">
<p><a href="/wiki/The_Collector" title="The Collector"><img alt="Map-Collector.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-Collector.png/300px-Map-Collector.png?fd6983" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="boss-img" srcset="/images/thumb/Map-Collector.png/450px-Map-Collector.png?fd6983 1.5x, /images/Map-Collector.png?fd6983 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a>
</p>
<div class="boss-name"><a href="/wiki/The_Collector" title="The Collector">The Collector</a></div>
</div>
<div class="boss">
<p><a href="/wiki/The_Champ" title="The Champ"><img alt="Map-Champ.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-Champ.png/300px-Map-Champ.png?8759b9" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="boss-img" srcset="/images/thumb/Map-Champ.png/450px-Map-Champ.png?8759b9 1.5x, /images/Map-Champ.png?8759b9 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a>
</p>
<div class="boss-name"><a href="/wiki/The_Champ" title="The Champ">The Champ</a></div>
</div>
</div>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Act_3:_The_Beyond">Act 3: The Beyond</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Bosses?veaction=edit&amp;section=8" title="Edit section: Act 3: The Beyond" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Bosses?action=edit&amp;section=8" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Act 3: The Beyond"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<p>One of these bosses will appear on floor 50. On <span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="20" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">Ascension</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">20</span></sup></span>, a second boss (different from the first) will appear on floor 51.
</p>
<div class="center-table">
<div class="boss">
<p><a href="/wiki/Awakened_One" title="Awakened One"><img alt="Map-Awakened.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-Awakened.png/300px-Map-Awakened.png?bfea9f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="boss-img" srcset="/images/thumb/Map-Awakened.png/450px-Map-Awakened.png?bfea9f 1.5x, /images/Map-Awakened.png?bfea9f 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a>
</p>
<div class="boss-name"><a href="/wiki/Awakened_One" title="Awakened One">Awakened One</a></div>
</div>
<div class="boss">
<p><a href="/wiki/Time_Eater" title="Time Eater"><img alt="Map-TimeEater.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-TimeEater.png/300px-Map-TimeEater.png?74ceb5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="boss-img" srcset="/images/thumb/Map-TimeEater.png/450px-Map-TimeEater.png?74ceb5 1.5x, /images/Map-TimeEater.png?74ceb5 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a>
</p>
<div class="boss-name"><a href="/wiki/Time_Eater" title="Time Eater">Time Eater</a></div>
</div>
<div class="boss">
<p><a href="/wiki/Donu_and_Deca" title="Donu and Deca"><img alt="Map-DonuDeca.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-DonuDeca.png/300px-Map-DonuDeca.png?a007ef" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" class="boss-img" srcset="/images/thumb/Map-DonuDeca.png/450px-Map-DonuDeca.png?a007ef 1.5x, /images/Map-DonuDeca.png?a007ef 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a>
</p>
<div class="boss-name"><a href="/wiki/Donu_and_Deca" title="Donu and Deca">Donu and Deca</a></div>
</div>
</div>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Act_4:_The_Ending">Act 4: The Ending</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Bosses?veaction=edit&amp;section=9" title="Edit section: Act 4: The Ending" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Bosses?action=edit&amp;section=9" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Act 4: The Ending"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<p>The Heart appears on floor 55 (<span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="20" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">56</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">20</span></sup></span>).
</p>
<div class="center-table">
<div class="boss">
<p><a href="/wiki/Corrupt_Heart" title="Corrupt Heart"><img alt="Map-CorruptHeart.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-CorruptHeart.png/400px-Map-CorruptHeart.png?9f6024" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="400" height="400" class="boss-img" srcset="/images/Map-CorruptHeart.png?9f6024 1.5x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a>
</p>
<div class="boss-name"><a href="/wiki/Corrupt_Heart" title="Corrupt Heart">Corrupt Heart</a></div>
</div>
</div>
